    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MedFlow — Human Handoff\n\nHuman takeover template.\n\n**Webhook path:** `medflow/human-handoff`\n**MedFlow env (outbound from MedFlow):** `N8N_WEBHOOK_STAFF_INTERVENTION`\n**Callback:** `POST /api/webhooks/staff-intervention`\n\nEscalation from voice AI or orchestrator.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "13ee0d8f-b5a1-4cf6-ad4d-d4a2a88509ca",
